msgid "Install Perry"
msgstr "Installer Perry"

#: src/getting-started/installation.md:49
msgid "npm / npx (recommended — any platform)"
msgstr "npm / npx (recommandé — toute plateforme)"

#: src/getting-started/installation.md:51
msgid ""
"Perry ships as a prebuilt-binary npm package. This is the fastest way to get "
"started and the only path that covers all seven host binary variants (macOS "
"arm64/x64, Linux x64/arm64 glibc + musl, Windows x64) with a single command:"
msgstr ""
"Perry est livré sous forme de paquet npm binaire préconstruit. C'est le "
"moyen le plus rapide de commencer et le seul chemin qui couvre les sept "
"variantes binaires hôtes (macOS arm64/x64, Linux x64/arm64 glibc + musl, "
"Windows x64) avec une seule commande:"

#: src/getting-started/installation.md:54
msgid "# Project-local (pins Perry's version alongside your deps)"
msgstr "# Projet-local (pins la version de Perry à côté de vos dépôts)"

#: src/getting-started/installation.md:57
msgid "# Global"
msgstr "# Global"

#: src/getting-started/installation.md:61
msgid "# Zero-install, one-shot"
msgstr "# Installation à zéro, une prise"

#: src/getting-started/installation.md:66
msgid ""
"[`@perryts/perry`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@perryts/perry) is a thin "
"launcher; npm automatically picks the matching prebuilt via "
"`optionalDependencies` (`@perryts/perry-darwin-arm64`, `@perryts/perry-linux-"
"x64-musl`, etc.) based on your `os` / `cpu` / `libc`. Requires Node.js ≥ 16."
msgstr ""
"[`@perryts/perry`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@perryts/perry) est un "
"lanceur léger ; npm sélectionne automatiquement le binaire précompilé "
"correspondant via `optionalDependencies` (`@perryts/perry-darwin-arm64`, "
"`@perryts/perry-linux-x64-musl`, etc.) selon vos `os` / `cpu` / `libc`. "
"Requiert Node.js ≥ 16."

