#: src/native-libraries/overview.md:91
msgid "1. Module resolution"
msgstr "1. Résolution de module"

#: src/native-libraries/overview.md:93
msgid ""
"Perry's resolver ([`crates/perry/src/commands/compile/resolve.rs`](https://"
"github.com/PerryTS/perry/blob/main/crates/perry/src/commands/compile/"
"resolve.rs)) walks each search path looking for `node_modules/mysql2/`:"
msgstr ""
"Le résolveur de Perry ([`crates/perry/src/commands/compile/resolve.rs`]"
"(https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/blob/main/crates/perry/src/commands/"
"compile/resolve.rs)) parcourt chaque chemin de recherche à la recherche de "
"`node_modules/mysql2/` :"

#: src/native-libraries/overview.md:97
msgid ""
"**If `node_modules/mysql2/package.json` exists with a `perry.nativeLibrary` "
"block**: parse the manifest, treat the package as a native binding. Skip "
"layers (c) and (d)."
msgstr ""
"**Si `node_modules/mysql2/package.json` existe avec un bloc "
"`perry.nativeLibrary`** : analyser le manifeste, traiter le package comme un "
"binding natif. Ignorer les couches (c) et (d)."

#: src/native-libraries/overview.md:100
msgid ""
"**If `mysql2` is selected through `perry.compilePackages`**: compile the "
"installed JavaScript package source. This is the intended long-term path for "
"`mysql2` and other source packages."
msgstr ""
"**Si `mysql2` est sélectionné via `perry.compilePackages`**: compiler la "
"source du paquet JavaScript installé. Il s'agit de la trajectoire à long "
"terme prévue pour `mysql2` et les autres paquets source."

#: src/native-libraries/overview.md:103
msgid ""
"**Otherwise**: consult the **well-known table** at [`crates/perry/"
"well_known_bindings.toml`](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/blob/main/crates/"
"perry/well_known_bindings.toml). The table maps `mysql2` → `perry-ext-"
"mysql2` (a Rust crate that ships in the Perry install). The user didn't `npm "
"install` anything; Perry handles it."
msgstr ""
"**Autrement**: consulter le **Tableau bien connu** à [`crates/perry/"
"well_known_bindings.toml`](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/blob/main/crates/"
"perry/well_known_bindings.toml). Le tableau montre `mysql2` → `perry-ext-"
"mysql2` (une caisse Rust qui est expédiée dans l'installation Perry). "
"L'utilisateur n'a rien `npm install`; Perry le gère."

#: src/native-libraries/overview.md:109
msgid "**If nothing matches**: compile error pointing at the import line."
msgstr ""
"**Si rien ne correspond** : erreur de compilation pointant vers la ligne "
"d'import."

#: src/native-libraries/overview.md:111
msgid "2. ABI version check"
msgstr "2. Vérification de la version ABI"

#: src/native-libraries/overview.md:113
msgid ""
"If the resolved binding has a `perry.nativeLibrary.abiVersion` field "
"(required from v0.6.0 onwards; warning-only in v0.5.x), Perry verifies the "
"declared semver range covers the bundled `perry-ffi` version. A binding "
"declaring `\"0.5\"` loads under any `0.5.x` Perry; one declaring `\"^1.0\"` "
"loads only under `1.x`. Mismatches are a hard compile error with a recipe "
"pointing at the offending package."
msgstr ""
"Si le binding résolu possède un champ `perry.nativeLibrary.abiVersion` "
"(obligatoire à partir de la v0.6.0 ; avertissement uniquement en v0.5.x), "
"Perry vérifie que la plage semver déclarée couvre la version `perry-ffi` "
"intégrée. Un binding déclarant `\"0.5\"` se charge sous n'importe quel Perry "
"`0.5.x` ; un binding déclarant `\"^1.0\"` se charge uniquement sous la "
"version `1.x`. Les incompatibilités constituent une erreur de compilation "
"bloquante accompagnée d'un message pointant vers le package fautif."

