"text.set(value))\n"
"stateBindTextfield(text, field) // programmatic text.set() also updates the "
"field\n"
"\n"
"App({\n"
"    title: \"TextField\",\n"
"    width: 400,\n"
"    height: 200,\n"
"    body: VStack(12, [\n"
"        field,\n"
"        Text(`You typed: ${text.value}`),\n"
"    ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:121
msgid ""
"`TextField(placeholder, onChange)` fires `onChange` as the user types. Pair "
"with `stateBindTextfield(state, field)` for two-way binding so programmatic "
"`state.set(…)` also updates the visible text."
msgstr ""
"`TextField(placeholder, onChange)` déclenche `onChange` à chaque frappe de "
"l'utilisateur. Associez-le à `stateBindTextfield(state, field)` pour une "
"liaison bidirectionnelle, afin que `state.set(…)` par programme mette "
"également à jour le texte affiché."

