msgstr ""
"**`Table(rows, cols, renderer)`** — macOS uniquement. Prend désormais en "
"charge `tableSetSortColumn`, `tableSetFilterText` et la sélection multiple "
"depuis la v0.5.636 (#473)."

#: src/ui/widgets.md:479
msgid "**`QRCode(data, size)`** — macOS only. Renders a QR code."
msgstr "**`QRCode(data, size)`** — macOS uniquement. Affiche un code QR."

#: src/ui/widgets.md:480
msgid ""
"**`Canvas(width, height, draw)`** — all desktop platforms. A drawing "
"surface; see [Canvas](canvas.md)."
msgstr ""
"**`Canvas(width, height, draw)`** — toutes les plateformes de bureau. Une "
"surface de dessin ; voir [Canvas](canvas.md)."

#: src/ui/widgets.md:482
msgid ""
"**`CameraView()`** — iOS only (other platforms planned). See [Camera]"
"(camera.md)."
msgstr ""
