#: src/ui/layout.md:43
msgid ""
"Layers children on top of each other (back to front). `ZStack()` takes no "
"constructor children — populate it with `widgetAddChild`:"
msgstr ""
"Superpose les enfants les uns sur les autres (de l'arrière vers l'avant). "
"`ZStack()` ne prend pas d'enfants dans son constructeur — peuplez-le avec "
"`widgetAddChild` :"

#: src/ui/layout.md:46
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const layered = ZStack()\n"
"widgetAddChild(layered, ImageFile(\"background.png\"))\n"
"widgetAddChild(layered, Text(\"Overlay text\"))\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const layered = ZStack()\n"
"widgetAddChild(layered, ImageFile(\"background.png\"))\n"
"widgetAddChild(layered, Text(\"Overlay text\"))\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/layout.md:52 src/platforms/macos.md:35 src/platforms/ios.md:61
#: src/platforms/tvos.md:60 src/platforms/watchos.md:149
#: src/platforms/android.md:37 src/platforms/windows.md:61
#: src/platforms/linux.md:51 src/testing/geisterhand.md:94
msgid "ScrollView"
msgstr "ScrollView"

#: src/ui/layout.md:54
msgid ""
"A scrollable container. Built empty, then filled via `scrollviewSetChild`:"
msgstr ""
"Un conteneur défilant. Créé vide, puis alimenté via `scrollviewSetChild` :"

#: src/ui/layout.md:56
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"// ScrollView() takes no args; populate it with `scrollviewSetChild`.\n"
"const sv = ScrollView()\n"
"const inner = VStack(8, [Text(\"a\"), Text(\"b\"), Text(\"c\")])\n"
"scrollviewSetChild(sv, inner)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"// ScrollView() takes no args; populate it with `scrollviewSetChild`.\n"
"const sv = ScrollView()\n"
"const inner = VStack(8, [Text(\"a\"), Text(\"b\"), Text(\"c\")])\n"
"scrollviewSetChild(sv, inner)\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/layout.md:63
msgid "LazyVStack"
msgstr "LazyVStack"

#: src/ui/layout.md:65
msgid ""
"A vertically scrolling list that lazily renders items. More efficient than "
"`ScrollView` + `VStack` for thousands of rows — on macOS this is backed by "
"`NSTableView` so only rows in the visible rect are realized."
msgstr ""
"Une liste à défilement vertical qui affiche les éléments de façon "
"paresseuse. Plus efficace que `ScrollView` + `VStack` pour des milliers de "
"lignes — sur macOS, ceci est soutenu par `NSTableView` de sorte que seules "
"les lignes dans le rectangle visible sont instanciées."

#: src/ui/layout.md:69
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"// `render(index)` is invoked lazily — only rows in the visible rect are "
"realized.\n"
"const lazy = LazyVStack(1000, (index: number) => Text(`Row ${index}`))\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"// `render(index)` is invoked lazily — only rows in the visible rect are "
"realized.\n"
"const lazy = LazyVStack(1000, (index: number) => Text(`Row ${index}`))\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/layout.md:74
msgid ""
"When the underlying data changes, call `lazyvstackUpdate(handle, newCount)` "
"to refresh. Override the default 44pt row height with "
"`lazyvstackSetRowHeight`."
msgstr ""
"Lorsque les données sous-jacentes changent, appelez "
"`lazyvstackUpdate(handle, newCount)` pour actualiser. Remplacez la hauteur "
"de ligne par défaut de 44pt avec `lazyvstackSetRowHeight`."

#: src/ui/layout.md:77
msgid "NavStack"
msgstr "NavStack"

#: src/ui/layout.md:79
msgid ""
"A navigation container that supports push/pop navigation. Push a new view "
"with `navstackPush(stack, view, title)`; pop with `navstackPop(stack)`:"
msgstr ""
"Un conteneur de navigation qui prend en charge la navigation push/pop. "
"Affichez une nouvelle vue avec `navstackPush(stack, view, title)` ; revenez "
"en arrière avec `navstackPop(stack)` :"

#: src/ui/layout.md:82
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const home = VStack(16, [\n"
"    Text(\"Home Screen\"),\n"
"    Button(\"Go to Details\", () => {\n"
"        navstackPush(nav, Text(\"Details!\"), \"Details\")\n"
"    }),\n"
"])\n"
"const nav = NavStack()\n"
"widgetAddChild(nav, home)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const home = VStack(16, [\n"
"    Text(\"Home Screen\"),\n"
"    Button(\"Go to Details\", () => {\n"
"        navstackPush(nav, Text(\"Details!\"), \"Details\")\n"
"    }),\n"
"])\n"
"const nav = NavStack()\n"
"widgetAddChild(nav, home)\n"
"```"

