#: src/ui/tray.md:41
msgid "`trayCreate(iconPath: string): Widget`"
msgstr "`trayCreate(iconPath: string): Widget`"

#: src/ui/tray.md:41
msgid ""
"Create the tray icon. `iconPath` is a filesystem path to a PNG (or `.icns` "
"on macOS, `.ico` on Windows). Pass `\"\"` to use a \"●\" placeholder."
msgstr ""
"Crée l'icône de la barre des tâches. `iconPath` est un chemin vers un "
"fichier PNG (ou `.icns` sous macOS, `.ico` sous Windows). Passez `\"\"` pour "
"utiliser un placeholder \"●\"."

#: src/ui/tray.md:42
msgid "`traySetIcon(tray, iconPath)`"
msgstr "`traySetIcon(tray, iconPath)`"

#: src/ui/tray.md:42
msgid "Hot-swap the icon image. Empty path is a no-op."
msgstr "Remplace l'image de l'icône à chaud. Un chemin vide est sans effet."

#: src/ui/tray.md:43
msgid "`traySetTooltip(tray, tooltip)`"
msgstr "`traySetTooltip(tray, tooltip)`"

#: src/ui/tray.md:43
msgid "Set the tooltip text shown on hover."
msgstr "Définit le texte de l'infobulle affiché au survol."

#: src/ui/tray.md:44
msgid "`trayAttachMenu(tray, menu)`"
msgstr "`trayAttachMenu(tray, menu)`"

#: src/ui/tray.md:44
msgid ""
"Attach a context menu (built with `menuCreate` / `menuAddItem`). Right-click "
"— or left-click on macOS — opens the menu."
msgstr ""
"Attache un menu contextuel (construit avec `menuCreate` / `menuAddItem`). Un "
"clic droit — ou un clic gauche sous macOS — ouvre le menu."

#: src/ui/tray.md:45
msgid "`trayOnClick(tray, callback)`"
msgstr "`trayOnClick(tray, callback)`"

#: src/ui/tray.md:45
msgid ""
"Register a left-click handler. On macOS the menu pops on left-click, so this "
"only fires when no menu is attached; on Windows / Linux, left-click and menu "
"are independent."
msgstr ""
"Enregistre un gestionnaire de clic gauche. Sous macOS, le menu s'ouvre au "
"clic gauche, donc ce gestionnaire ne se déclenche que lorsqu'aucun menu "
"n'est attaché ; sous Windows / Linux, le clic gauche et le menu sont "
"indépendants."

#: src/ui/tray.md:46
msgid "`trayDestroy(tray)`"
msgstr "`trayDestroy(tray)`"

#: src/ui/tray.md:46
msgid ""
"Remove the icon. The handle stays valid (subsequent setters are no-ops) so "
"existing closures don't crash."
msgstr ""
"Supprime l'icône. Le handle reste valide (les appels aux setters suivants "
"sont sans effet) afin que les closures existantes ne plantent pas."

#: src/ui/tray.md:48
msgid "Updating the Icon"
msgstr "Mise à jour de l'icône"

#: src/ui/tray.md:50
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"// Hot-swap the icon. The path can be a PNG (every platform), .icns\n"
"// (macOS), or .ico (Windows). Empty path is a no-op.\n"
"traySetIcon(tray, \"./assets/tray.png\")\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"// Hot-swap the icon. The path can be a PNG (every platform), .icns\n"
"// (macOS), or .ico (Windows). Empty path is a no-op.\n"
"traySetIcon(tray, \"./assets/tray.png\")\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/tray.md:56
msgid "Removal"
msgstr "Suppression"

#: src/ui/tray.md:58
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"// Remove the tray icon. After this, the handle is dead — set_icon /\n"
"// set_tooltip / attach_menu calls become no-ops.\n"
"trayDestroy(tray)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"// Remove the tray icon. After this, the handle is dead — set_icon /\n"
"// set_tooltip / attach_menu calls become no-ops.\n"
"trayDestroy(tray)\n"
"```"

