#: src/platforms/overview.md:40
msgid "Use the `__platform__` compile-time constant to branch by platform:"
msgstr ""
"Utilisez la constante de compilation `__platform__` pour effectuer des "
"branchements selon la plateforme :"

#: src/platforms/overview.md:42 src/platforms/wearos.md:157
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"declare const __platform__: number\n"
"\n"
"// Platform constants:\n"
"// 0 = macOS\n"
"// 1 = iOS\n"
"// 2 = Android\n"
"// 3 = Windows\n"
"// 4 = Linux\n"
"// 5 = Web (browser, --target web / --target wasm)\n"
"// 6 = tvOS\n"
"// 7 = watchOS\n"
"// 8 = visionOS\n"
"\n"
"if (__platform__ === 0) {\n"
"    console.log(\"Running on macOS\")\n"
"} else if (__platform__ === 1) {\n"
"    console.log(\"Running on iOS\")\n"
"} else if (__platform__ === 3) {\n"
"    console.log(\"Running on Windows\")\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"declare const __platform__: number\n"
"\n"
"// Platform constants:\n"
"// 0 = macOS\n"
"// 1 = iOS\n"
"// 2 = Android\n"
"// 3 = Windows\n"
"// 4 = Linux\n"
"// 5 = Web (browser, --target web / --target wasm)\n"
"// 6 = tvOS\n"
"// 7 = watchOS\n"
"// 8 = visionOS\n"
"\n"
"if (__platform__ === 0) {\n"
"    console.log(\"Running on macOS\")\n"
"} else if (__platform__ === 1) {\n"
"    console.log(\"Running on iOS\")\n"
"} else if (__platform__ === 3) {\n"
"    console.log(\"Running on Windows\")\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/platforms/overview.md:65
msgid ""
"`__platform__` is resolved at compile time. The compiler constant-folds "
"comparisons and eliminates dead branches, so platform-specific code has zero "
"runtime cost."
msgstr ""
"`__platform__` est résolue au moment de la compilation. Le compiler évalue "
"les comparaisons comme des constantes et élimine les branches mortes, de "
"sorte que le code spécifique à une plateforme n'a aucun coût à l'exécution."

