#: src/platforms/wearos.md:3
msgid ""
"Perry can compile TypeScript apps for Wear OS watches and the Wear OS "
"emulator."
msgstr ""
"Perry peut compiler des applications TypeScript pour les montres Wear OS et "
"l'émulateur Wear OS."

#: src/platforms/wearos.md:5
msgid ""
"Wear OS **is Android on a watch**, so Perry reuses the exact same backend as "
"the [Android](android.md) target: your `perry/ui` tree lowers through `perry-"
"ui-android` (JNI → `TextView` / `LinearLayout` / `Button` / …), and the "
"compiled `aarch64-linux-android` `.so` is identical to a phone build. `perry "
"run wearos` then packages it with a **watch form-factor overlay** — the "
"`android.hardware.type.watch` feature, the standalone meta-data, and the "
"`androidx.wear` support library — and installs it over `adb` like any other "
"APK."
msgstr ""
"Wear OS **est Android sur une montre**, donc Perry réutilise exactement le "
"même backend que la cible [Android](android.md): votre arbre `perry/ui` "
"descend à travers `perry-ui-android` (JNI → `TextView` / `LinearLayout` / "
"`Button` / ...), et le `aarch64-linux-android` `.so` compilé est identique à "
"une compilation de téléphone. `perry run wearos` est ensuite emballé avec un "
"**superposition du facteur de forme de la montre** la fonction "
"`android.hardware.type.watch`, les métadonnées autonomes et la bibliothèque "
"de support `androidx.wear`  et l'installe sur `adb` comme tout autre APK."

#: src/platforms/wearos.md:13
msgid ""
"This page is about **full Wear OS apps**. For glanceable Wear OS **Tiles** "
"(the swipe-left surfaces, built from `Widget({...})` declarations), see "
"[Wear OS Tiles](../widgets/wearos.md)."
msgstr ""
"Cette page concerne **les applications Wear OS complètes**. Pour Wear OS "
"**Carreaux** (les surfaces glissées vers la gauche, construites à partir des "
"déclarations `Widget({...})`), voir [Wear OS Carreaux](../widgets/wearos.md)."

