msgstr "Réseau et HTTP"

#: src/stdlib/overview.md:29
msgid ""
"**node:http** / **node:https** / **node:http2** — Node.js stdlib HTTP server "
"modules + WebSocket upgrade dispatch (issue #577). The full "
"`IncomingMessage` / `ServerResponse` surface plus TLS via rustls and HTTP/2 "
"via ALPN. See [HTTP & Networking](http.md#nodejs-compatibility--nodehttp--"
"nodehttps--nodehttp2)."
msgstr ""
"**node:http** / **node:https** / **node:http2** — Modules serveur HTTP de la "
"stdlib Node.js + dispatch de mise à niveau WebSocket (issue #577). La "
"surface complète `IncomingMessage` / `ServerResponse` ainsi que TLS via "
"rustls et HTTP/2 via ALPN. Voir [HTTP & Réseau](http.md#nodejs-"
"compatibility--nodehttp--nodehttps--nodehttp2)."

#: src/stdlib/overview.md:30
msgid ""
"**hono** — runtime-agnostic web framework. `app.fetch` works end-to-end via "
"`compilePackages`, and long-lived native servers can adapt it through "
"`node:http` or `@perryts/hono-server`. See [HTTP & Networking → Hono]"
"(http.md#hono); the old link gap was closed in [\\#589](https://github.com/"
"PerryTS/perry/issues/589)."
msgstr ""
"**le respect** cadre web indépendant du temps d'exécution. `app.fetch` "
"fonctionne de bout en bout via `compilePackages`, et les serveurs natifs à "
"longue durée de vie peuvent l'adapter via `node:http` ou `@perryts/hono-"
"server`. Voir [HTTP et réseautage → Hono](http.md#hono); l'ancien espace de "
"liaison a été fermé dans [\\#589](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/"
"589)."

