#: src/stdlib/utilities.md:84
msgid ""
"Both the single-argument form and the replacement/options overload route to "
"the native implementation. The supported options are `replacement`, `lower`, "
"`strict`, and `trim`; `remove`, `locale`, `extend`, and the complete "
"upstream character map remain outside the current faithfulness boundary."
msgstr ""
