#: src/i18n/overview.md:1
msgid "Internationalization (i18n)"
msgstr "Internationalisation (i18n)"

#: src/i18n/overview.md:3
msgid ""
"Perry's i18n system lets you write natural English strings and have them "
"automatically translated at compile time. Zero ceremony, near-zero runtime "
"cost."
msgstr ""
"Le système i18n de Perry vous permet d'écrire des chaînes naturelles en "
"anglais et de les faire traduire automatiquement à la compilation. Zéro "
"cérémonie, coût d'exécution quasi nul."

#: src/i18n/overview.md:5
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"// String literals in UI component calls are automatically localizable "
"keys.\n"
"// (Conceptually the docs write `Button(\"Next\")` / `Text(\"Hello, {name}!"
"\", ...)`\n"
"// from \"perry/ui\"; we exercise the runtime API that backs them — t() — "
"here.)\n"
"const next = t(\"Next\")                                  // Automatically "
"localized\n"
"const hello = t(\"Hello, {name}!\", { name: \"Alice\" })    // With "
"interpolation\n"
"console.log(next, hello)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"// String literals in UI component calls are automatically localizable "
"keys.\n"
"// (Conceptually the docs write `Button(\"Next\")` / `Text(\"Hello, {name}!"
"\", ...)`\n"
"// from \"perry/ui\"; we exercise the runtime API that backs them — t() — "
"here.)\n"
"const next = t(\"Next\")                                  // Automatically "
"localized\n"
"const hello = t(\"Hello, {name}!\", { name: \"Alice\" })    // With "
"interpolation\n"
"console.log(next, hello)\n"
"```"

#: src/i18n/overview.md:14
msgid ""
"The same key-resolution and interpolation runs through the explicit `t()` "
"API for non-UI strings:"
msgstr ""
"La même résolution de clé et la même interpolation passent par l'API "
"explicite `t()` pour les chaînes hors interface :"

#: src/i18n/overview.md:16
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"import { t, Currency, Percent, ShortDate, LongDate, FormatNumber, "
"FormatTime, Raw } from \"perry/i18n\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"import { t, Currency, Percent, ShortDate, LongDate, FormatNumber, "
"FormatTime, Raw } from \"perry/i18n\"\n"
"```"

#: src/i18n/overview.md:20
msgid "Design Principles"
msgstr "Principes de conception"

#: src/i18n/overview.md:22
msgid ""
"**Zero ceremony**: String literals in UI components are automatically "
"localizable keys"
msgstr ""
"**Zéro cérémonie** : les littéraux de chaîne dans les composants UI sont "
"automatiquement des clés localisables"

#: src/i18n/overview.md:23
msgid ""
"**Compile-time diagnostics**: Missing and unused translation keys are "
"reported as warnings during build (missing keys fall back to the default "
"locale's text)"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnostics au moment de la compilation**: Les clés de traduction "
"manquantes et inutilisées sont signalées comme avertissements pendant la "
"compilation (les clés manquantes reviennent au texte de la locale par défaut)"

#: src/i18n/overview.md:24
msgid ""
"**Embedded string table**: All translations baked into the binary as a flat "
"2D table. Near-zero runtime lookup cost"
msgstr ""
"**Table de chaînes intégrée** : toutes les traductions sont intégrées dans "
"le binaire sous forme d'une table 2D plate. Coût de recherche à l'exécution "
"quasi nul"

#: src/i18n/overview.md:25
msgid ""
"**Native locale detection**: POSIX locale environment variables first "
"(`LANGUAGE`, `LC_ALL`, `LC_MESSAGES`, `LANG`), then platform OS APIs — so "
"CLI binaries respect the environment and GUI apps (which carry no locale env "
"vars) use the OS setting"
msgstr ""
"**Détection de localisation native**: les variables de l'environnement local "
"de POSIX d'abord (`LANGUAGE`, `LC_ALL`, `LC_MESSAGES`, `LANG`), puis les API "
"du système d'exploitation de la plateforme  afin que les binaires CLI "
"respectent l'environnement et les applications GUI (qui n'ont pas "
"d'environnements de localisation) utilisent le réglage du système "
"d'exploitation"

#: src/i18n/overview.md:29
msgid "1. Add i18n config to perry.toml"
msgstr "1. Ajoutez la configuration i18n dans perry.toml"

#: src/i18n/overview.md:31
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"[i18n]\n"
"locales = [\"en\", \"de\"]\n"
"default_locale = \"en\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```toml\n"
"[i18n]\n"
"locales = [\"en\", \"de\"]\n"
"default_locale = \"en\"\n"
"```"

#: src/i18n/overview.md:37
