"les emplacements accessibles en écriture par l'utilisateur (`~/"
"Applications`, `~/.local/bin`, `%LOCALAPPDATA%`). UAC / `SMJobBless` est une "
"préoccupation distincte."

#: src/updater/overview.md:427
msgid ""
"**Delta updates** (bsdiff), **multi-channel** (stable / beta), **staged "
"rollouts**."
msgstr ""
"**Mises à jour delta** (bsdiff), **multi-canal** (stable / beta), "
"**déploiements progressifs**."

#: src/updater/overview.md:429
msgid ""
"**Notarization / code-signing** during install. Binaries are expected to "
