msgstr "Tester votre flux de mise à jour"

#: src/updater/overview.md:434
msgid ""
"The crate ships smoke-test scripts that exercise verify → install → relaunch "
"end-to-end against a real Perry binary:"
msgstr ""
"Le crate inclut des scripts de smoke test qui exercent le flux verify → "
"install → relaunch de bout en bout sur un vrai binaire Perry :"

