#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:3
msgid "Define home screen widgets using the `Widget()` function."
msgstr ""
"Définissez des widgets d'écran d'accueil à l'aide de la fonction `Widget()`."

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:5
msgid ""
"**Status:** the full `Widget({...})` snippets on this page compile-link "
"cleanly on the host LLVM target via [`docs/examples/widgets/snippets.ts`]"
"(https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/blob/main/docs/examples/widgets/"
"snippets.ts), so the API shapes are verified against the codegen. The actual "
"cross-compile targets (`--target ios-widget`/`android-widget`/`watchos-"
"widget`/`wearos-tile`) can be driven by the doc-tests harness with a `// "
"widget-bundle-id:` banner ([\\#194](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/"
"194)). These shared snippets do not request those targets, so their regular "
"CI coverage remains the host compile/link path; SDK-backed target coverage "
"runs only where the required Xcode or Android toolchain is installed. For "
"the canonical end-to-end shape see [`examples/widget_demo.ts`](https://"
"github.com/PerryTS/perry/blob/main/examples/widget_demo.ts). Fragments below "
"that show partial syntax (just the `entryFields` object, just a `render:` "
"body, etc.) are rendered as plain text — the full declarations they appear "
"inside are covered by the verified anchors."
msgstr ""
"**Le statut:** les extraits complets de `Widget({...})` sur cette page sont "
"compilés et reliés à la cible LLVM de l'hôte via [`docs/examples/widgets/"
"snippets.ts`](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/blob/main/docs/examples/"
"widgets/snippets.ts), de sorte que les formes de l'API sont vérifiées par "
"rapport au codegen. Les cibles réelles de compilation croisée (`--target ios-"
"widget`/`android-widget`/`watchos-widget`/`wearos-tile`) peuvent être "
"pilotées par le harnais de doc-tests avec une bannière `// widget-bundle-"
"id:` ([\\#194](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/194)). Ces extraits "
"partagés ne demandent pas ces cibles, de sorte que leur couverture CI "
"régulière reste le chemin compile/link hôte; la couverture cible prise en "
"charge par le SDK s'exécute uniquement lorsque la chaîne d'outils Xcode ou "
"Android requise est installée. Pour la forme canonique de bout en bout, voir "
"[`examples/widget_demo.ts`](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/blob/main/"
"examples/widget_demo.ts). Les fragments ci-dessous qui montrent une syntaxe "
"partielle (seulement l'objet `entryFields`, juste un corps `render:`, etc.) "
"sont rendus sous forme de texte brut  les déclarations complètes qu'ils "
"contiennent sont couvertes par les ancres vérifiées."

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:21
msgid "Widget Declaration"
msgstr "Déclaration de Widget"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:23
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"Widget({\n"
"    kind: \"WeatherWidget\",\n"
"    displayName: \"Weather\",\n"
"    description: \"Shows current weather\",\n"
"    entryFields: {\n"
"        temperature: \"number\",\n"
"        condition: \"string\",\n"
"        location: \"string\",\n"
"    },\n"
"    render: (entry) =>\n"
"        VStack([\n"
"            HStack([\n"
"                Text(entry.location),\n"
"                Spacer(),\n"
"                Image(\"cloud.sun.fill\"),\n"
"            ]),\n"
"            Text(`${entry.temperature}°`),\n"
"            Text(entry.condition),\n"
"        ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"Widget({\n"
"    kind: \"WeatherWidget\",\n"
"    displayName: \"Weather\",\n"
"    description: \"Shows current weather\",\n"
"    entryFields: {\n"
"        temperature: \"number\",\n"
"        condition: \"string\",\n"
"        location: \"string\",\n"
"    },\n"
"    render: (entry) =>\n"
"        VStack([\n"
"            HStack([\n"
"                Text(entry.location),\n"
"                Spacer(),\n"
"                Image(\"cloud.sun.fill\"),\n"
"            ]),\n"
"            Text(`${entry.temperature}°`),\n"
"            Text(entry.condition),\n"
"        ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"

