#: src/widgets/components.md:220
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"Widget({\n"
"    kind: \"StatsWidget\",\n"
"    displayName: \"Stats\",\n"
"    description: \"Shows daily stats\",\n"
"    entryFields: {\n"
"        steps: \"number\",\n"
"        calories: \"number\",\n"
"        distance: \"string\",\n"
"    },\n"
"    // Inline-options modifier form — the `.font(\"title\").bold()` chain "
"form\n"
"    // parses but its modifiers don't reach the codegen (#195).\n"
"    render: (entry) =>\n"
"        VStack([\n"
"            HStack([\n"
"                Image(\"figure.walk\"),\n"
"                Text(\"Daily Stats\", { font: \"headline\" }),\n"
"            ]),\n"
"            Spacer(),\n"
"            HStack([\n"
"                VStack([\n"
"                    Text(`${entry.steps}`, { font: \"title\", fontWeight: "
"\"bold\" }),\n"
"                    Text(\"steps\", { font: \"caption\", color: "
"\"gray\" }),\n"
"                ]),\n"
"                Spacer(),\n"
"                VStack([\n"
"                    Text(`${entry.calories}`, { font: \"title\", fontWeight: "
"\"bold\" }),\n"
"                    Text(\"cal\", { font: \"caption\", color: \"gray\" }),\n"
"                ]),\n"
"                Spacer(),\n"
"                VStack([\n"
"                    Text(entry.distance, { font: \"title\", fontWeight: "
"\"bold\" }),\n"
"                    Text(\"km\", { font: \"caption\", color: \"gray\" }),\n"
"                ]),\n"
"            ]),\n"
"        ], { padding: 16 }),\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"Widget({\n"
"    kind: \"StatsWidget\",\n"
"    displayName: \"Stats\",\n"
"    description: \"Shows daily stats\",\n"
"    entryFields: {\n"
"        steps: \"number\",\n"
"        calories: \"number\",\n"
"        distance: \"string\",\n"
"    },\n"
"    // Inline-options modifier form — the `.font(\"title\").bold()` chain "
"form\n"
"    // parses but its modifiers don't reach the codegen (#195).\n"
"    render: (entry) =>\n"
"        VStack([\n"
"            HStack([\n"
"                Image(\"figure.walk\"),\n"
"                Text(\"Daily Stats\", { font: \"headline\" }),\n"
"            ]),\n"
"            Spacer(),\n"
"            HStack([\n"
"                VStack([\n"
"                    Text(`${entry.steps}`, { font: \"title\", fontWeight: "
"\"bold\" }),\n"
"                    Text(\"steps\", { font: \"caption\", color: "
"\"gray\" }),\n"
"                ]),\n"
"                Spacer(),\n"
"                VStack([\n"
"                    Text(`${entry.calories}`, { font: \"title\", fontWeight: "
"\"bold\" }),\n"
"                    Text(\"cal\", { font: \"caption\", color: \"gray\" }),\n"
"                ]),\n"
"                Spacer(),\n"
"                VStack([\n"
"                    Text(entry.distance, { font: \"title\", fontWeight: "
"\"bold\" }),\n"
"                    Text(\"km\", { font: \"caption\", color: \"gray\" }),\n"
"                ]),\n"
"            ]),\n"
"        ], { padding: 16 }),\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/widgets/components.md:261
msgid "[Creating Widgets](creating-widgets.md) — Widget() API"
msgstr "[Création de widgets](creating-widgets.md) — API Widget()"

#: src/widgets/configuration.md:1
msgid "Widget Configuration"
msgstr "Configuration des widgets"

#: src/widgets/configuration.md:3
msgid ""
"Perry widgets support user-configurable parameters. On iOS/watchOS, these "
"compile to AppIntent configurations (the \"Edit Widget\" sheet). On Android/"
"Wear OS, they compile to a Configuration Activity."
msgstr ""
"Les widgets Perry prennent en charge des paramètres configurables par "
"l'utilisateur. Sur iOS/watchOS, ils se compilent en configurations AppIntent "
"(la feuille « Modifier le widget »). Sur Android/Wear OS, ils se compilent "
"en une Configuration Activity."

#: src/widgets/configuration.md:5
msgid ""
"**Status:** the full `TopSitesWidget` declaration below compile-links "
"cleanly on the host LLVM target via [`docs/examples/widgets/snippets.ts`]"
"(https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/blob/main/docs/examples/widgets/"
"snippets.ts), so the `config: { ... }` shape is verified against "
"`parse_config_params` in `crates/perry-hir/src/lower.rs`. The shorter "
"fragments lower on the page (just a `provider:` body, just a `config:` "
"object) are rendered as plain text — they're not standalone declarations. "
"The doc-tests harness can pass the required bundle id through its `// widget-"
"bundle-id:` banner ([\\#194](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/194)). "
"This page's shared snippet requests only the host compile/link check; actual "
"widget-target runs remain conditional on an available Xcode or Android SDK."
msgstr ""
"**Le statut:** la déclaration complète `TopSitesWidget` ci-dessous est "
"compilée en lien avec la cible LLVM hôte via [`docs/examples/widgets/"
"snippets.ts`](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/blob/main/docs/examples/"
"widgets/snippets.ts), de sorte que la forme `config: { ... }` est vérifiée "
"par rapport à `parse_config_params` dans `crates/perry-hir/src/lower.rs`. "
"Les fragments plus courts en bas de la page (seulement un corps `provider:`, "
"juste un objet `config:`) sont rendus en texte brut  ils ne sont pas des "
"déclarations autonomes. Le harnais doc-tests peut passer l'identifiant de "
"faisceau requis à travers sa bannière `// widget-bundle-id:` ([\\#194]"
"(https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/194)). L'extrait partagé de cette "
"page ne demande que la vérification compile/link de l'hôte; les exécutions "
"réelles du widget-cible restent conditionnelles à un SDK Xcode ou Android "
"disponible."

#: src/widgets/configuration.md:17
msgid "Defining Config Fields"
msgstr "Définir des champs de configuration"

#: src/widgets/configuration.md:19
msgid ""
"Add a `config` object to your `Widget()` declaration. Each field specifies a "
"type, allowed values, a default, and a display title."
msgstr ""
"Ajoutez un objet `config` à votre déclaration `Widget()`. Chaque champ "
"spécifie un type, les valeurs autorisées, une valeur par défaut et un titre "
"d'affichage."

#: src/widgets/configuration.md:21
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"Widget({\n"
"    kind: \"TopSitesWidget\",\n"
"    displayName: \"Top Sites\",\n"
"    description: \"Your top performing sites\",\n"
"    supportedFamilies: [\"systemSmall\", \"systemMedium\"],\n"
"    appGroup: \"group.com.example.shared\",\n"
"\n"
"    config: {\n"
"        sortBy: {\n"
"            type: \"enum\",\n"
"            values: [\"clicks\", \"impressions\", \"ctr\", \"position\"],\n"
"            default: \"clicks\",\n"
"            title: \"Sort By\",\n"
"        },\n"
"        dateRange: {\n"
"            type: \"enum\",\n"
"            values: [\"7d\", \"28d\", \"90d\"],\n"
"            default: \"7d\",\n"
"            title: \"Date Range\",\n"
"        },\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    entryFields: {\n"
"        total: \"number\",\n"
"        label: \"string\",\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    provider: async (config: { sortBy: string; dateRange: string }) => {\n"
"        const res = await fetch(\n"
"            `https://api.example.com/stats?sort=${config.sortBy}&range=$"
"{config.dateRange}`,\n"
"        )\n"
"        const data = await res.json()\n"
"        return {\n"
"            entries: [{ total: data.total, label: data.label }],\n"
"            reloadPolicy: { after: { minutes: 30 } },\n"
"        }\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    render: (entry) =>\n"
"        VStack([\n"
"            Text(`${entry.total}`, { font: \"title\", fontWeight: "
"\"bold\" }),\n"
"            Text(entry.label, { font: \"caption\", color: \"secondary\" }),\n"
"        ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"Widget({\n"
"    kind: \"TopSitesWidget\",\n"
"    displayName: \"Top Sites\",\n"
"    description: \"Your top performing sites\",\n"
"    supportedFamilies: [\"systemSmall\", \"systemMedium\"],\n"
"    appGroup: \"group.com.example.shared\",\n"
"\n"
"    config: {\n"
"        sortBy: {\n"
"            type: \"enum\",\n"
"            values: [\"clicks\", \"impressions\", \"ctr\", \"position\"],\n"
"            default: \"clicks\",\n"
"            title: \"Sort By\",\n"
"        },\n"
"        dateRange: {\n"
"            type: \"enum\",\n"
"            values: [\"7d\", \"28d\", \"90d\"],\n"
"            default: \"7d\",\n"
"            title: \"Date Range\",\n"
"        },\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    entryFields: {\n"
"        total: \"number\",\n"
"        label: \"string\",\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    provider: async (config: { sortBy: string; dateRange: string }) => {\n"
"        const res = await fetch(\n"
"            `https://api.example.com/stats?sort=${config.sortBy}&range=$"
"{config.dateRange}`,\n"
"        )\n"
"        const data = await res.json()\n"
"        return {\n"
"            entries: [{ total: data.total, label: data.label }],\n"
"            reloadPolicy: { after: { minutes: 30 } },\n"
"        }\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    render: (entry) =>\n"
"        VStack([\n"
"            Text(`${entry.total}`, { font: \"title\", fontWeight: "
"\"bold\" }),\n"
"            Text(entry.label, { font: \"caption\", color: \"secondary\" }),\n"
"        ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"

