"deprecates that API in favor of [`AppStore.requestReview(in:)`](https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/storekit/appstore/"
"requestreview(in:)-1q8qs). Treat the legacy call as a compatibility "
"implementation detail; new extension releases should move to "
"`AppStore.requestReview(in:)` when their minimum OS allows it."
msgstr ""
